      "A fractional CMO running four engagements is usually doing a version of the same twelve things at each one. Positioning audit. Message testing. Channel scoring. Funnel diagnosis. Content operating rhythm. Attribution cleanup. The specifics differ. The sequence and the judgement calls do not.",
