      "There is a specific and unglamorous feature set that decides whether a cautious buyer proceeds. An audit trail showing what happened, when, and on whose authority. A clear data retention answer. Role-based access that reflects how the buyer's organisation actually works. Exportability, so the buyer is not trapped. And evidence: named customers, real numbers, honest sample sizes.",
      "None of those demo well. All of them decide deals. Founders consistently under-invest in them because they are invisible in a product tour and because building them feels like overhead rather than product.",
