      "Micro-niches grew 340% against broad market platforms. The categories rising are vertical SaaS for ignored industries, private AI for regulated sectors, SME compliance tracking, agent workflow tooling, and real-estate administration. The categories fading are generic model wrappers, all-in-one tools, and anything without an audit trail or a privacy story.",
